  "title": "Slow Cooker Steak Salad with Cilantro Lime Dressing",
  "description": "Slow-cooked skirt steak is tossed with fresh corn, romaine hearts, and avocado and drizzled in a cilantro-lime dressing to make this convenient, low-carb dinner.",
